I am standing near a black-and-yellow taxi.
I have two bags.
I put the bags in the taxi.
I sit in the taxi.
I respectfully call the driver 'dada'.
My new address is on my phone.
I show him the phone.
He reads the address.
He nods.
And the taxi starts.
Driver dada asks me.
"Madam, are you new to Mumbai?"
"Are you a tourist?"
"No dada, I am not a tourist," I say.
"My name is Maya."
"My work is in Mumbai."
"I am a software engineer."
"Welcome to Mumbai, Madam," he says with a smile.
I look out the window.
This city is very big.
